  "title": "Skyward Specialty Launches New Power Generation Coverage Solution - Skyward Specialty Insurance",
  "summary": "Skyward Specialty announced the launch of its new Power Generation insurance solution for small to mid-sized entities, expanding its offerings to meet the evolving needs of power producers and brokers across the U.S. The solution delivers tailored coverage across the asset lifecycle and complements the Company’s Renewable Energy program, providing purpose-built capacity for today’s increasingly complex power generation risks.",
